# Yve, Astrowarden

> Yve does not win teamfights by outdamaging anyone. She wins by deciding where the fight is allowed to happen: her ultimate turns a stretch of the map into a toll gate, and every border crossing costs the enemy. She is the highest-ceiling zoning mage in mid lane, and she pays off only when you force the geometry first.

