## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Zone Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when your team already covers cooldown tempo and early Magic Penetration matters more than repeated poke cycles.; Wishing Lantern over Blood Wings when Use against high-HP front lines that stay inside Void Crystal and Starfield long enough to trigger current-HP damage.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one diver can still reach Yve before the Starfield zone has forced the fight apart.
- Total cost: 10940 gold

Default ranked mid build that keeps Yve's cooldown loop, slow stacking, burn pressure, and late penetration online for objective zones.

### Frontline Siege (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Enchanted Talisman over Blood Wings when Use when repeated river fights are draining mana before Lord setups and you need more cooldown headroom.; Genius Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team has multiple magic damage threats that can exploit stacked Magic Defense reduction.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when your front line reliably peels and the last slot can stay pure damage.
- Total cost: 11120 gold

Anti-frontline setup for tankier drafts where Yve is allowed to keep enemies inside layered slows and current-HP magic damage.

### Anti-Dive Control (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Pull Yourself Together, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but not crowd-control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude and Purify together.; Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when the enemy cannot hard-engage Yve and permanent shield plus movement is more valuable than Frozen.; Immortality over Divine Glaive when Use in closing Lord fights where one death after a failed Starfield position loses the base.
- Total cost: 10740 gold

Defensive mid build for hard pick and dive drafts where Yve must survive the first lockout before committing Real World Manipulation.

